Package: cplxshrink
Type: Package
Title: Paired Bayesian Shrinkage for Complex Regression
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Cheng-Han", "Yu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "cheng-han.yu@marquette.edu",
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6977-6400")),
    person("Qishi", "Zhan", role = "aut"))
Description: Fits paired complex and scalar real Bayesian regressions with
    Student-t, lasso, and generalized double Pareto Gaussian scale mixtures.
    Complex regression is computed through its exact structured real
    representation. Provides posterior coefficient summaries and synthetic
    reference tests for the sampling distributions.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: Rcpp, stats
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), jsonlite
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
